  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Job Creation in Mykolaiv and Odesa and to Social Dialogue Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to enhance early recovery efforts in Mykolaiv and Odesa by expanding access to income and livelihood opportunities at the local level and 2) improve sectoral and regional social dialogue in Ukraine. The project will engage vulnerable and inactive groups in primarily Mykolaiv and Odesa regions in the work force, especially internal displaced persons, women, war veterans, persons with disabilities and older workers. This will happen through local employment partnerships, targeted training, support to entrepreneurs and strengthening of social dialog at both national and regional level.</narrative>
  </description>
